  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: generate environment client factories 2026-05-08\n- feat: add union pick and switch helpers 2026-05-08\n- feat: add multipart stream upload overloads 2026-05-05\n- feat: improve generated SDK behavior and tests 2026-05-05\n- feat(cli): autosdk skill emits multifile bundle by default 2026-04-18\n- feat(cli): add `autosdk skill` command to generate Claude SKILL.md 2026-04-18\n- feat: add opt-in microsoft extensions integrations 2026-04-17\n- [codex] Generate SDK snippets from OpenAPI examples (#265) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] generate polling helpers from vendor metadata (#269) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] Add first-class idempotency header support (#266) 2026-04-11\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix(cli): normalize generated CLI source whitespace 2026-05-07\n- fix: make generated metadata trim safe 2026-05-07\n- fix: pin stream discriminator in multipart uploads 2026-05-05\n- fix: compile raw segment serialization 2026-04-29\n- fix: stabilize multipart array serialization 2026-04-29\n- fix: harden multipart serialization 2026-04-29\n- fix: improve multipart form generation 2026-04-29\n- fix(asyncapi): avoid duplicate subprotocol locals 2026-04-18\n- fix: add asyncapi websocket subprotocol auth 2026-04-17\n- fix: score nested anyof envelope properties 2026-04-17",
